    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quem, an adventurer, is the first person to step foot in the dungeon, &quot;Heaven's Ladder&quot;, in over 500 years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not long after she does so, a strange shadowy monster casts some sort of curse on her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Come deep\u2015\u2015into\u2015\u2015this place\u2015\u2015I shall await you at\u2015\u2015the highest spot\u2015\u2015&quot;, the apparition says before vanishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to break the curse, Quem teams up with the adventurer Vise to explore the dungeon and to uncover the meaning behind those mysterious words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Classic Style Action RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an Ancient Dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch Between Melee and Ranged Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subquest System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapon Enhancing System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay Cleared Dungeons</p></li></ul>",
